  "selfCorrectionsBeforeHandoff": [
    "The complete suite on 6bae07c passed all 3285 behavioral tests but failed discovery because src/regexp/test.ts was treated as an empty test suite. Renamed it to intrinsic.ts and updated its import with no behavior change; final revision received full validation again.",
    "First empty-repetition fixture stayed below 200000 compiler visits. Enlarged to three nested repetitions to exercise exhaustion; no valid outcome was changed.",
    "Sirv frame assertion initially expected MemberExpression; shared member calls annotate CallExpression. Corrected to actual trim callee; diagnostic, mrmime source and EMFILE sibling asserted.",
    "Eager method metadata exposed an import-cycle hazard in a new test import. Intrinsic initialization is now lazy.",
    "Native matrix with 128-character ambiguous nonmatches hit its 10-second timeout. Used short native cross-product inputs (816 exact pairs) and separate 4096-unit VM ambiguity/budget probes. Timeout never supplied a matching result.",
    "Own replacement trim control initially hit pre-existing sloppy primitive receiver boxing. Declared its source strict; no boxing implementation or weaker assertion.",
    "Predecessor full suite hit the external 300-second limit after 97 passes; a second predecessor run was intentionally stopped after spotting missing typed boundaries for array/function primitive conversion. Four native-checked red controls reproduced legacy failures. New explicit conversion-domain boundaries retain siblings. Final source received a fresh full run with 900 seconds."
  ],
